event: response.output_text.done
data: {"type":"response.output_text.done","content_index":0,"item_id":"msg_0a7a31b14995de9a016a68b9bcd7288197b9e0cc08bb9ca752","logprobs":[],"output_index":1,"sequence_number":85,"text":"PASS\n\n## Final verdict\n\n**Overall voice-effect assessment:** The passage appropriately names the reader’s present doubt without shaming or arguing with them. “At this moment it may well seem impossible to you” acknowledges their current experience, while “you will see that belief for what it is” gives the method calm, earned authority. The register is right for this pre-dismantling moment."}

